# E-Paper Studio Web - Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to apps/web/.env.local or configure in your deployment dashboard (e.g. Vercel)
#
# NOTE: E-Paper Studio operates 100% client-side in production.
# PDF generation is performed entirely in the browser using self-hosted fonts and Canvas/jsPDF.
# No backend service, Render, Railway, or external API keys are required!

# (Optional) Deprecated: external backend renderer URL if running standalone CLI worker
# VITE_RENDERER_URL=
# VITE_RENDERER_API_KEY=
